OL,3,AMurder probe as two people dead in
OL,4,Ahouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched after two people died in a
OL,8,Fhouse fire.
OL,10,FThe blaze in Grangetown, Middlesbrough,
OL,11,Fbroke out just before 05:30 BST and
OL,12,Falso left a woman in hospital in a
OL,13,Fcritical condition, alongside a further
OL,14,Fthree people who suffered non-life
OL,15,Fthreatening injuries.
OL,17,FCleveland Police said it was
OL,18,Finvestigating what had happened but was
OL,19,F"keeping an open mind and cannot rule
OL,20,Fout any links to wider organised crime
OL,21,Fat this time".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
