OL,3,AEx-chief constable investigated over
OL,4,AIsraeli fan ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe IOPC launched an independent
OL,7,Finvestigation in January to examine the
OL,8,Finvolvement of West Midlands Police
OL,9,Fofficers in the planning and
OL,10,Fpreparation of the match at Villa Park
OL,11,Fon 6 November 2025.
OL,13,FThe ban attracted national and
OL,14,Finternational debate, with the
OL,15,Fgovernment saying it would do
OL,16,Feverything in its power to have it
OL,17,Foverturned.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
